#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Desktop & Windows"
msgstr "Desktop & Jendela"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:562
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Each message uses a compact metadata column — the author's nick (or the "
"origin, like System or Error) above a smaller timestamp — beside the message"
" text, which gets the wider column. This reads well on phones while keeping "
"the retro monospace look."
msgstr ""
"Setiap pesan menggunakan kolom metadata kompak - nick penulis (atau asal, "
"seperti Sistem atau Error) di atas penanda waktu yang lebih kecil - di "
"samping teks pesan, yang mendapat kolom lebih lebar. Ini tertulis baik di "
"telepon sambil menjaga tampilan monospace retro."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:209
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Edit Menu"
msgstr "Sunting Menu"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:243
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Edit menu"
msgstr "Sunting menu"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:11
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Identity & Presence"
msgstr "Identitas & Kehadiran"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:51
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Look up current or recent user information from a dialog, nickname context "
"menus, or slash commands."
msgstr ""
"Cari informasi pengguna saat ini atau baru-baru ini dari dialog, menu "
"konteks nama panggilan, atau perintah slash."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/services.ex:97
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Manage SOP, AOP, and VOP access lists for registered channels."
msgstr ""
"Mengelola SOP, AOP, dan VOP daftar akses untuk saluran yang terdaftar."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:250
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Manage nickname registration, profile bio, away status, and user modes from "
"the Account dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kelola pendaftaran nama panggilan, profil bio, status jauh, dan mode "
"pengguna dari dialog Akun."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:290
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Manage server bots from Tools > Bot Management, including status, "
"capabilities, channels, custom commands, and events."
msgstr ""
"Kelola bot server dari Perkakas > Manajemen Bot, termasuk status, kemampuan,"
" saluran, perintah kustom, dan peristiwa."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:549
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Message Layout"
msgstr "Tata Letak Pesan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:166
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Message of the Day"
msgstr "Pesan Hari Ini"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1147
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Network Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik Jaringan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:178
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Open the current server Message of the Day from Help > Message of the Day."
msgstr "Buka Pesan Server Hari Ini dari Pesan Bantuan > Hari ini."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/bots.ex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Reference for all /bot subcommands and the admin dialog opened by /bot with "
"no arguments."
msgstr ""
"Referensi untuk semua < ph0 > < / ph0 > subcommands dan dialog admin dibuka "
"oleh < ph1 > < / ph1 > tanpa argumen."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Register or identify your nickname, change your nick, set a bio, toggle away"
" status, and manage personal user modes."
msgstr ""
"Register atau mengidentifikasi nama panggilan Anda, ubah nama panggilan "
"Anda, atur bio, ubah status, dan mengelola mode pengguna pribadi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/services.ex:75
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Register, inspect, and drop the current channel through ChanServ commands or"
" Channel Central."
msgstr ""
"Register, pemeriksaan, dan drop saluran saat ini melalui perintah ChanServ "
"atau Channel Central."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/channel_modes.ex:126
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Restrict channel access to invited users; non-members can request access "
"from Channel List."
msgstr ""
"Batasi akses kanal ke pengguna yang diundang; bukan anggota dapat meminta "
"akses dari Daftar Saluran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:74
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Send wallops messages to users with +w enabled or urgent announcements to "
"every connected user."
msgstr ""
"Kirim pesan wallop ke pengguna dengan + w diaktifkan atau pengumuman "
"mendesak ke setiap pengguna yang terhubung."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:230
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Send, receive, and manage channel invitations with optional auto-join on "
"invite."
msgstr ""
"Kirim, menerima, dan mengelola undangan saluran dengan otomatis opsional "
"bergabung pada undangan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:59
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Server Broadcasts"
msgstr "Siaran Server"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/channel_modes.ex:79
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Set or clear the message shown to users when they join a channel."
msgstr ""
"Atur atau bersihkan pesan yang ditunjukkan ke pengguna ketika mereka "
"bergabung dengan saluran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/commands.ex:281
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Show the current notice routing policy. Notices are always routed to the "
"active window."
msgstr ""
"Tunjukkan kebijakan routing pemberitahuan saat ini. Pemberitahuan selalu "
"diarahkan ke jendela aktif."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:58
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The Connect screen is a logon-style desktop too: the connect dialog is a "
"pinned window centered over the taskbar, with Help available from its Start "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Layar Sambung adalah desktop gaya logon- juga: dialog koneksi adalah jendela"
" berpusat pada batang tugas, dengan Bantuan tersedia dari menu Start."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1168
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The Network panel during a call shows live connection health (a MOS score), "
"latency, jitter, packet loss, up/download bitrate, video resolution and "
"frame rate, and whether quality is limited by CPU or bandwidth. Collapse it "
"with the toolbar button. See also: Call Quality, Connection Diagram."
msgstr ""
"Panel jaringan selama panggilan menunjukkan kesehatan sambungan langsung (a "
"MOS skor), latensi, jitter, kerugian paket, atas < ph0 > < / ph0 > bitrate, "
"resolusi video dan laju frame, dan apakah kualitas dibatasi oleh CPU atau "
"bandwidth. Gulingkan dengan tombol bilah alat. Lihat juga: Hubungi Kualitas,"
" Diagram Koneksi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The chat runs on a Windows-style desktop: the chat itself is one pinned "
"window (maximized by default) that you can restore, drag and resize, over a "
"taskbar with a Start menu and a tray clock. Window layout persists across "
"visits. "
msgstr ""
"Obrolan yang dijalankan pada desktop bergaya Windows-: Percakapan itu "
"sendiri adalah salah satu jendela yang disematkan (dimaksimalkan secara "
"baku) yang dapat dikembalikan, seret dan ubah ukuran, melalui batang taskbar"
" dengan menu awal dan jam baki. Tata letak jendela berlanjut di seluruh "
"kunjungan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:257
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Timers Dialog"
msgstr "Dialog Penghitung"

