#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1016
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Join a channel-scoped audio/video conference with pre-join device preview, "
"layout controls, participant moderation, and live statistics. Conference "
"moderation follows channel permissions: half-operators and above can "
"moderate lower-ranked participants."
msgstr ""
"Bergabung dengan saluran-scoped audio < ph0 > < / ph0 > konferensi dengan "
"pre- join preview perangkat, kontrol tata letak, moderasi peserta, dan "
"statistik hidup. Moderasi konferensi mengikuti izin saluran: setengah "
"operator dan di atas dapat moderat peserta peringkat rendah."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1084
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "P2P Sessions in Chat"
msgstr "Sesi P2P dalam Percakapan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The chat, the solo arcade and this Help viewer share the same window "
"manager. The Help viewer is laid out like the classic Windows Help: a "
"toolbar (Back / Forward / Home), a navigator with Contents, Index and Search"
" tabs, and a \"See Also\" list of related topics under each article."
msgstr ""
"Obrolan, arcade solo dan penontonnya berbagi jendela yang sama. Penilik "
"Bantuan ditata seperti Windows Help klasik: toolbar (Back / Forward / Home),"
" navigator dengan Isi, Indeks dan tab Pencarian, dan daftar topik yang "
"terkait di bawah setiap artikel."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2516
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The game library opens as a draggable, maximizable window right on the chat "
"desktop — no separate page. Launching a game opens it in a new browser "
"window so it gets full keyboard focus."
msgstr ""
"Pustaka permainan dibuka sebagai jendela yang dapat dilepas dan dapat diukur"
" tepat di desktop obrolan - tidak ada halaman terpisah. Meluncurkan sebuah "
"permainan membukanya di jendela peramban baru sehingga ia mendapat fokus "
"keyboard penuh."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3339
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"When you enter a Space, a character picker appears first: choose from the "
"classic Hero or one of seven classes — Sorceress, Knight, Archer, Barbarian,"
" Rogue, Cleric or Monk. Each shows an animated preview and has its own "
"walking and attack animations; click one to enter the map wearing it, and "
"everyone in the space sees your choice. The picker shows again each time you"
" re-enter, defaulting to your last pick."
msgstr ""
"Ketika Anda memasuki ruang angkasa, karakter pemetik muncul pertama: pilih "
"dari Hero klasik atau salah satu dari tujuh kelas - penyihir, Knight, "
"Archer, Barbarian, Rogue, Pendeta atau Monk. Setiap menunjukkan pratinjau "
"animasi dan memiliki sendiri berjalan dan menyerang animasi; klik satu untuk"
" memasukkan peta memakainya, dan semua orang di luar angkasa melihat pilihan"
" Anda. The picker menunjukkan lagi setiap kali Anda re-enter, default ke "
"pilihan terakhir Anda."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2511
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"gameplay tips before launching. Open the Games menu and choose Arcade to "
"start (you must be registered and identified). "
msgstr ""
"tips gameplay sebelum meluncurkan. Buka menu Games dan pilih Arcade untuk "
"memulai (Anda harus terdaftar dan diidentifikasi)."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3335
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "pick character"
msgstr "karakter pick"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1051
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Monitor call quality with real-time quality indicators. See also: Network "
"Statistics."
msgstr ""
"Monitor kualitas panggilan dengan indikator kualitas real-time. Lihat juga: "
"Statistik Jaringan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3313
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A multiplayer 8-bit virtual space built into every channel: people in the "
"channel can switch from Chat to Space, walk around the shared map, and keep "
"using the same channel conversation. Move with the Arrow keys, WASD or the "
"on-screen pad in the bottom-right corner — tap for a single step or hold to "
"walk continuously; Space or the pad's sword button swings your weapon. The "
"translucent button in the top-right corner switches the space to fullscreen "
"and back."
msgstr ""
"Multiplayer 8- bit ruang maya yang dibangun ke setiap saluran: orang-orang "
"di saluran dapat beralih dari Chat ke Space, berjalan mengelilingi peta "
"bersama, dan terus menggunakan percakapan saluran yang sama. Bergerak dengan"
" tombol panah, WASD, atau pad di layar pada pojok kanan bawah — tekan untuk "
"satu langkah atau tahan untuk berjalan terus-menerus; Spasi atau tombol "
"pedang pada pad mengayunkan senjata Anda. Tombol tembus pandang di pojok "
"kanan atas mengalihkan Space ke layar penuh dan kembali."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2523
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Every game is also listed directly in the Games menu — pick one to jump "
"straight to its detail screen."
msgstr ""
"Setiap game juga tercantum langsung di menu Games — pilih salah satu untuk "
"langsung menuju layar detailnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1323
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Audit Log"
msgstr "Log Audit Admin"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1380
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Broadcast"
msgstr "Penyiaran Pengelola"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1422
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Channels"
msgstr "Kanal Admin"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1402
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Danger Zone"
msgstr "Atur Zona Bahaya"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1342
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin MOTD"
msgstr "Aadmin MOTD"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1301
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Server Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Server Admin"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1364
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin TURN"
msgstr "admin TURN"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1451
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Users"
msgstr "Penyedia Pengguna"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3363
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Characters in a Space can spar with each other: press Space (or the pad's "
"sword button) next to another standing character to land a hit. Each hit "
"deals damage and shows a small health bar under their name; at zero HP the "
"character is knocked down for a few seconds, then gets back up on their own "
"with full health. Sitting characters are out of combat, and a knockout never"
" has any lasting effect — it is all in good fun."
msgstr ""
"Karakter dalam ruang angkasa dapat berlatih satu sama lain: tekan spasi "
"(atau tombol pedang pad) di samping karakter berdiri lain untuk mendaratkan "
"pukulan. Masing-masing mencapai kesepakatan kerusakan dan menunjukkan sebuah"
" bar kesehatan kecil di bawah nama mereka; di nol HP karakter diturunkan "
"untuk beberapa detik, kemudian kembali pada mereka sendiri dengan kesehatan "
"penuh. Sat characters are out of battle, and a knockout never have any "
"lasting effect - it is all in good."

