#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:541
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Arcade links can render as rich cards with Join/Open actions while they are "
"live. P2P requests use the PM header for Start/Join/Decline and keep "
"transcript rows as inert history showing request, connected and ended "
"states."
msgstr ""
"Arkade link dapat membuat kartu kaya dengan Bergabung < ph0 > < / ph0 > aksi"
" ketika mereka hidup. P2P meminta menggunakan kepala PM untuk Start < ph1 > "
"< / ph1 > < ph2 > < / ph2 > dan menjaga baris transkrip sebagai riwayat "
"inert menunjukkan permintaan, terhubung dan berakhir negara bagian."

